{"request_id": "c4cfe26a-aff9-4590-b70e-f77fdf9f7e29", "target": "medibot", "decision": "allowed", "blocked_at": null, "reasons": [], "failed_closed": false, "principal": "billing_executive", "question": "What documents are needed for a cashless claim?", "answer": "The cashless\u2011claim process requires the following documents\u202f[1]:\n\n1. **Duly filled insurer\u2011specific pre\u2011authorisation form** (download from the insurer portal).  \n2. **Admission note** with provisional diagnosis and matching ICD\u201110 code from\u202fbilling_codes.pdf.  \n3. **Treating doctor\u2019s treatment plan** and estimated length of stay (LOS).  \n4. **Cost estimate** mapped to the relevant package rate.  \n5. **Patient KYC**: policy card / e\u2011card, government photo ID, and policy number.  \n6. **For accident cases**: MLC (Medico\u2011Legal Case) number and FIR copy where applicable.", "guardrail": {"id": "88d4lvtw4xdw", "version": "3"}, "usage": {"topicPolicyUnits": 0, "contentPolicyUnits": 1, "wordPolicyUnits": 0, "sensitiveInformationPolicyUnits": 1, "sensitiveInformationPolicyFreeUnits": 1, "contextualGroundingPolicyUnits": 3}, "latency_ms": 2271.7, "trace_id": "01a0ff33-9141-7c52-b954-adb78aacedf2", "detail": null, "at": "2026-10-03T00:39:27.010588+00:00"}
