{"request_id": "4820b087-f445-4798-b84d-d9744d651cce", "target": "medibot", "decision": "masked", "blocked_at": null, "reasons": ["PHONE", "PHONE", "PHONE", "PHONE", "PHONE", "PHONE", "PHONE", "PHONE"], "failed_closed": false, "principal": "billing_executive", "question": "Give me the TPA desk phone number and postal address from the billing documents.", "answer": "**TPA desk phone numbers (as listed in the billing documents)**  \n\n- **Bupa** \u2013 In\u2010house TPA desk: **{PHONE}**  \n- **Care Health** \u2013 In\u2010house TPA desk: **{PHONE}**  \n- **Star Health** \u2013 In\u2010house TPA desk: **{PHONE}**  \n- **HDFC Ergo** \u2013 In\u2010house TPA desk: **{PHONE}**  \n- **ICICI Lombard** \u2013 In\u2010house TPA desk: **{PHONE}**  \n- **New India Assurance** \u2013 MedSave TPA desk: **{PHONE}**  \n- **United India** \u2013 Medi Assist TPA desk: **{PHONE}**  \n- **Bajaj Allianz** \u2013 In\u2010house TPA desk: **{PHONE}**\n\n**Postal address**\n\nThe provided passages do not contain any postal address for the TPA desks. Therefore, a postal address cannot be supplied from the given billing documents.", "guardrail": {"id": "88d4lvtw4xdw", "version": "3"}, "restored": {"PHONE": 8}, "usage": {"topicPolicyUnits": 0, "contentPolicyUnits": 1, "wordPolicyUnits": 0, "sensitiveInformationPolicyUnits": 1, "sensitiveInformationPolicyFreeUnits": 1, "contextualGroundingPolicyUnits": 3}, "latency_ms": 17630.4, "trace_id": "01a0ff49-87a9-7d93-a009-1dfa88c22bc4", "detail": null, "at": "2026-10-03T01:03:41.855183+00:00"}
